# IGDB (Twitch) application credentials, read at BUILD TIME by src-tauri/src/igdb.rs.
#
# Copy to `.env` (gitignored) and fill in your own app from https://dev.twitch.tv/console/apps.
# In CI they come from the repository secrets IGDB_CLIENT_ID / IGDB_CLIENT_SECRET
# (see .github/workflows/release.yml).
#
# A build without these ships with IGDB cover lookups disabled — Steam capsules and
# manual/local covers still work. They are deliberately NOT embedded as fallback
# constants: an embedded client secret is extractable from every shipped binary.
IGDB_CLIENT_ID=
IGDB_CLIENT_SECRET=
